              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect, perfect, perfect! I can't believe with so few ingredients I've finally found what I was looking for - restaurant quality honey mustard sauce. I love chicken fingers, but can never find a good honey mustard sauce in the grocery store - they all taste terrible. I took a chance on this and am glad I did!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amy McCain"
            },
            "reviewBody": "How have I not come across this before? I followed another reviews suggestion of hearing the lemon juice and honey up and did equal amounts of dijon and yellow mustard knowing my families preferences. My kids fancy themselves honey mustard connoisseurs and said the sauce was their favorite ever. Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-22T15:57:23.063Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
